keyframes.prompt_template:
Generate a high-quality {aspect_ratio} photorealistic vertical image for this scene's END frame. This is keyframe K{scene_index} of {total_scenes}.

CRITICAL: generate exactly ONE single photographic frame. No multiple frames, panels, sub-images, split views, side-by-side comparisons, storyboard grids, comic-strip layouts, triptychs, or before-and-after compositions. ONE continuous photograph, ONE camera, ONE moment.

=== GLOBAL CONCEPT ===
{concept_prompt}

=== STYLE BIBLE ===
{style_bible}

=== SCENE END FRAME GOAL ===
{end_keyframe_prompt}

=== COMPOSITION RULES ===
{composition_rules}

=== CONTINUITY RULES ===
{continuity_rules}

=== GLOBAL RULES ===
{global_rules}

This is a faceless cinematic POV journey ending in a hidden luxurious secret living space. Honor the camera mode of this scene: first-person POV frames look like raw footage from a small handheld camera at chest/eye level (slightly imperfect, casual framing, body never visible except a brief hand on a control); drone-follow frames look like a cinematic drone or tracking shot of the lone hooded traveler from behind or above (face never shown). Keep the locked destination identity (same structure, weather, light, materials). The image must advance the journey only a believable short step from the previous keyframe. No on-screen text, numbers, logos, or watermarks. Single continuous frame only.

motion.prompt_template:
{kling_prompt}

This is a faceless cinematic POV journey toward and into a hidden luxurious secret living space. Honor the camera mode stated for this scene. MODE A FIRST-PERSON POV: animate authentic handheld first-person motion — subtle shake, footstep bob, breathing sway, slight off-center drift that self-corrects, small natural head turns — as if a real person is holding a small camera at chest/eye level. The traveler's body must never appear except a brief anatomically correct hand on a control. FORBIDDEN in POV: gimbal smoothness, Steadicam glide, dolly-smooth tracking, floating weightless camera, drone motion, video-game walkthrough camera. MODE B DRONE-FOLLOW: animate a single deliberate cinematic drone/tracking move following the lone hooded traveler from behind or above — gentle weighty motion, slight altitude and parallax, a faint natural wind drift, smooth but never weightless; face never shown. FORBIDDEN in drone-follow: handheld phone shake, teleporting, warping, camera passing through objects, video-game camera.

Keep the locked destination identity (same structure, weather, light, materials). Advance the journey only a believable short distance. When the secret door is operated, animate it as a real solid rigid object physically opening (swinging, sliding, or lifting) around a fixed pivot/track and staying open — it must NEVER vanish, dissolve, warp, or dematerialize, and any hand has correct anatomy and does not pass through it. The audio is natural diegetic sound only that matches the action exactly (sea, wind, rain, footsteps, the mechanism, ladder rungs, room tone) — absolutely NO music or score. Single continuous shot, no on-screen text.
